figma-safe-mcp
==============

This product includes software vendored from a third party.

engine/
-------
The contents of the `engine/` directory are derived from:

    figma-ds-cli (a.k.a. "figma-cli")
    Version:  2.1.0
    Author:   Sil Bormüller (Into Design Systems)
    Source:   https://github.com/silships/figma-cli
    License:  MIT (see engine/LICENSE)

The engine was vendored in a "Safe-Mode-only" form: the Chrome DevTools
Protocol / binary-patching capability ("Yolo mode") of the upstream project
has been removed, and a plugin access-key handshake has been added to the
local WebSocket bridge.

Files modified relative to upstream v2.1.0 (all other files are byte-identical
to upstream, to keep future upstream syncs a targeted re-diff):

    engine/src/figma-patch.js       — replaced with a neutered Safe-Mode stub
    engine/src/daemon.js            — CDP removed; plugin-mode only; WS access-key auth added
    engine/src/lib/cli-core.js      — plugin-mode daemon spawn; CDP fallbacks removed; key env pass-through; isolated state paths
    engine/src/commands/setup.js    — connect flow is Safe-Mode-only; unpatch removed
    engine/src/commands/misc.js     — `plugins` (voice) command removed

Files excluded from the vendored copy relative to upstream:

    src/figma-patch.js (replaced by stub)   plugins.js / plugins/voice/
    examples/   plant-care-dashboard/   docs/   CLAUDE.md
    src/.figma-client-*.mjs (generated temp artifact)
    upstream plugin/ (superseded by this repo's hardened plugin/)

